  "CharacterDescription": "Medger Cerwyn is the Lord of Castle Cerwyn - a Northern lord whose seat sits on the King's Road between Winterfell and the Wall. The Cerwyns have held this position for generations, reliable and loyal to the Starks. Medger is a solid man in his forties, not brilliant but dependable, exactly the kind of lord who shows up when his liege calls and does what is needed without complicating it. He has marched with Robb Stark. His son Cley is young. Castle Cerwyn is held by the household while the men are in the field.",
